[44.081174, "o", "Why this score\r\n"]
[47.081174, "o", "  •  SMB TCP accepts then returns no protocol response — TCP accept; SMB/NETBIOS session timed out \r\nwithout a dialect (The NETBIOS connection with the remote host timed out.)\r\n"]
[47.081355, "o", "  •  HTTP TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; request sent; no HTTP bytes before \r\ntimeout\r\n"]
[47.081566, "o", "  •  HTTP TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; no HTTPS/HTTP response before timeout\r\n"]
[47.081819, "o", "  •  HTTP proxy port TCP accepts then returns no response — TCP accept; proxy request sent; no HTTP \r\nbytes before timeout\r\n"]
[47.082148, "o", "  •  Multiple ports accept TCP then return no application response — 4 silent-accept faces across \r\nhttp, httpproxy, smb\r\n"]
[47.082376, "o", "  •  Multiple protocol tells corroborate the same host — +10% for 3 protocol lures (>1 at 5% each): \r\nhttp, httpproxy, smb\r\n"]
[47.082518, "o", "preset=both timeout=5.0s deep=False\r\n"]
